<!-- Cover — the title layout in slot mode. The theme owns the positions, so no alignment is written here.
     Only the "Q3" in the title is a gradient of two accent colors — token names, not a literal color
     (#0F65F9), so switching the theme turns the gradient into that theme's colors. -->
<slide id="cover" layout="title" enter="rise">
  <text slot="kicker" variant="kicker">Growth Team · 2026 Q3</text>
  <h1 slot="title" size="80"><span color="gradient(accent1 accent6, 90deg)">Q3</span> Business Review</h1>
  <text slot="subtitle" role="heading" size="30" color="muted">Growth metrics in review, and the plan for Q4</text>
  <text slot="author" role="body">Growth Team</text>
  <text slot="date" role="caption">October 2026 · Quarterly business meeting</text>
  <note>Thirty seconds of hello. Three things today: the metrics, what we learned, the plan — and one decision.</note>
</slide>
